classDiagram
  class ScoreRecord {
    +id string
    +name string
    +school string
    +cls string
    +exam string
    +examYm String_or_undefined
    +scores number[]
    +ranks number[]
    +totalRank number
    +ts string
    +mod string
    +_cid uuid
    +_by string
  }
  class CloudRow {
    +id uuid
    +rec_id string
    +stu_name string
    +school string
    +class_name string
    +exam string
    +exam_ym text_NEW
    +scores jsonb
    +ranks jsonb
    +total numeric
    +total_rank int
    +entered_at text
    +created_at timestamp
    +updated_at timestamp
    +last_editor text
    +owner_id uuid
    +owner_name text
  }
  CloudRow : existing 16 columns unchanged
  CloudRow : unique(stu_name,school,class_name,exam) unchanged

  class SyncLayer {
    +toRow(r) row
    +fromRow(row) record
    +fp(r) string
    +snapState(r) object
    +restoreState(r,s)
    +pushRows()
    +pullRows()
    +adoptByKey(r,row)
    +pushDeletes()
  }
  class ScoreSort {
    +defaultExamYm() string
    +makeExamYm(y,m) string
    +examYmOf(r) YmInfo
    +examOrderKey(r) OrderKey
    +sortByExam(rows) Array
    +examCmp(a,b) number
    +sort(list) Array
    +options(list) object
    +history(rows,idx,cur) object
    +examYmLabel(r) string
    +examAxisLabels(rows) Array
  }
  class ExportLayer {
    +backupJSON() object
    +normalizeRecord(r) record
    +restoreJSON(text) number
    +masterExportRows() UNCHANGED
  }
  class ScoreForm {
    +openForm(existing,onDone)
    +submit() bool
    +keep object
  }
  class Chart {
    +dualLine(opt)
    +opt.labels string[]
    +opt.labelTitles string[]_NEW
  }
  class Analysis {
    +trend.exams Array
    +bySubject Array
  }
  class ClassesCore {
    +classScoreAnalysis(classId,deps)
    +timeOf(r) number
  }
  class AppDB {
    +FORBIDDEN
    +define(name,opts)
  }

  SyncLayer ..> ScoreRecord : fromRow / toRow 映射 exam_ym ↔ examYm
  SyncLayer ..> CloudRow : 仅 score_records（独占）
  ExportLayer ..> ScoreRecord : 备份/恢复白名单 examYm
  ScoreForm ..> ScoreRecord : 写入 examYm
  ScoreForm ..> ScoreSort : makeExamYm / examYmOf
  ScoreSort ..> Analysis : 有序 studentRows
  ScoreSort ..> Chart : examAxisLabels
  ScoreSort ..> ClassesCore : sortByExam 供 perStudent
  AppDB ..> CloudRow : FORBIDDEN 禁止访问 score_records
